# Tifa Lockhart ({1}{G} 1/2, trample): "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, double Tifa Lockhart's power until end of
# turn" (CR 701.10b-c). Bot1 casts Tifa with two Mox Emeralds, then plays Wooded Foothills: that land entering doubles her to 2;
# cracking it puts a Forest onto the battlefield, a second land entering, which doubles her again to 4. The doubling lasts through
# the turn and ends at cleanup. Bot2's Island on turn 2 is no land Bot1 controls: she stays 1/2, and keeps trample.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Tifa Lockhart
Wooded Foothills
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tifa Lockhart.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Power = 1
Bot1.Hand.Wooded Foothills.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Wooded Foothills.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Toughness = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Power = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Tifa Lockhart.Keywords = Trample
